          "copyright": "© ℗ 2022 Yoto Ltd",
          "description": "Leave boredom behind on long journeys with this engaging musical activity Card all about travel! Complete with catchy Yoto Original songs like Pack Your Suitcase and I Want To See The World, kids are encouraged to engage in a wide range of journey-based activities - from helping to pack suitcases, to the classic I Spy.\n\nActivities include:\n\nPack Your Suitcase \nHow Will We Get There?\nAre We Nearly There Yet?\nI Want To See The World\nI Spy Song\n\nDiscover this full length card as you hit the road this summer. \nAvailable until 1st September. \nFor ages 3-10.",
